    "detailed_description": "<br><br> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go to Space. Save the Future. Try Not to Die.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \ud83c\udf0c \ud83d\ude80 Key Features \ud83d\ude80 \ud83c\udf0c </h2> </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/f4cc25a5e1127eabead111924fabaada.poster.avif?t=1688034331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/f4cc25a5e1127eabead111924fabaada.webm?t=1688034331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/f4cc25a5e1127eabead111924fabaada.mp4?t=1688034331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You need to have a constant awareness of your surroundings, manage engine levels and maintain all systems necessary for survival.<br></li><li> Solve any issues that may arise, you're in charge, and it is up to you to make decisions and prioritize maintenance work that will affect the capsule.<br></li><li> Navigate through obstacles and asteroids, dock to space stations, glide over Earth and return safely once your mission is complete.<br></li><li> Experience the desolation of the cosmos. Accompanied by extraordinary graphics and sound effects that will help you immerse in the story.<br></li><li> Try out a fascinating story mode that takes you on a crazy space ride from launch to landing.<br></li><li> Enjoy space in a free-float manner through the unrestrained Sandbox mode.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \ud83c\udf0c \ud83d\ude80 What is our game about? \ud83d\ude80 \ud83c\udf0c </h2> </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/b0a9983c4756b4d742153c066402d14a.poster.avif?t=1688034331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/b0a9983c4756b4d742153c066402d14a.webm?t=1688034331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/b0a9983c4756b4d742153c066402d14a.mp4?t=1688034331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome (back) to the world of Interkosmos for an even wilder, weirder and more wondrous adventure. <br><br>Experience the intense exhilaration of spaceflight. Explore the awe-inspiring interiors of a realistic space capsule.<br><br>Master the crucial systems that keep you in orbit (and breathing). While you\u2019re at it, try your best not to die.<br><br>If you complete your mission, you might save the future and yourself. Should you fail? That\u2019s a different story. Better load up the console and start spelling d-o-o-m\u2026<br><br>With more challenges, more stunning visuals and more mishaps than ever, the year 2000 has never looked so thrilling.",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go to Space. Save the Future. Try Not to Die.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \ud83c\udf0c \ud83d\ude80 Key Features \ud83d\ude80 \ud83c\udf0c </h2> </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/f4cc25a5e1127eabead111924fabaada.poster.avif?t=1688034331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/f4cc25a5e1127eabead111924fabaada.webm?t=1688034331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/f4cc25a5e1127eabead111924fabaada.mp4?t=1688034331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You need to have a constant awareness of your surroundings, manage engine levels and maintain all systems necessary for survival.<br></li><li> Solve any issues that may arise, you're in charge, and it is up to you to make decisions and prioritize maintenance work that will affect the capsule.<br></li><li> Navigate through obstacles and asteroids, dock to space stations, glide over Earth and return safely once your mission is complete.<br></li><li> Experience the desolation of the cosmos. Accompanied by extraordinary graphics and sound effects that will help you immerse in the story.<br></li><li> Try out a fascinating story mode that takes you on a crazy space ride from launch to landing.<br></li><li> Enjoy space in a free-float manner through the unrestrained Sandbox mode.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \ud83c\udf0c \ud83d\ude80 What is our game about? \ud83d\ude80 \ud83c\udf0c </h2> </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/b0a9983c4756b4d742153c066402d14a.poster.avif?t=1688034331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/b0a9983c4756b4d742153c066402d14a.webm?t=1688034331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/b0a9983c4756b4d742153c066402d14a.mp4?t=1688034331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome (back) to the world of Interkosmos for an even wilder, weirder and more wondrous adventure. <br><br>Experience the intense exhilaration of spaceflight. Explore the awe-inspiring interiors of a realistic space capsule.<br><br>Master the crucial systems that keep you in orbit (and breathing). While you\u2019re at it, try your best not to die.<br><br>If you complete your mission, you might save the future and yourself. Should you fail? That\u2019s a different story. Better load up the console and start spelling d-o-o-m\u2026<br><br>With more challenges, more stunning visuals and more mishaps than ever, the year 2000 has never looked so thrilling.",
